Clever Combatant	KEY:Halfling ~ Spheres Clever Combatant	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTraits.Halfling Racial Trait.SpecialQuality	PRERACE:1,Halfling	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Halfling ~ Spheres Clever Combatant],[!PREFACT:1,ABILITIES,Halfling_ReplaceFearless=true,Halfling_ReplaceHalflingLuck=true]	COST:0	FACT:Halfling_ReplaceFearless|true	FACT:Halfling_ReplaceHalflingLuck|true	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Scoundrel Sphere	DESC:Clever Combatant: In a world full of people larger and stronger, many a halfling learns that quick and clever action is the best method of self-defense. They gain the Scoundrel sphere as a bonus talent at 1st level. This replaces fearless and halfling luck. [SA:MRT]	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alternate-racial-traits#toc26
Brutally Trained	KEY:Half-Orc ~ Spheres Brutally Trained	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTraits.Half-Orc Racial Trait.SpecialQuality	PRERACE:1,Half-Orc	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Half-Orc ~ Spheres Brutally Trained],[!PREFACT:1,ABILITIES,HalfOrc_ReplaceIntimidating=true,HalfOrc_ReplaceWeaponFamiliarity=true]	COST:0	FACT:HalfOrc_ReplaceIntimidating|true	FACT:HalfOrc_ReplaceWeaponFamiliarity|true	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Equipment - Orc Heritage	DESC:Brutally Trained: Orcs and their kin have a noted fondness for direct, powerful weaponry. They gain the Orc Heritage Equipment talent as a bonus talent at 1st level. For half orcs, this replaces intimidating and weapon familiarity.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alternate-racial-traits#toc27
Trained Berserk	KEY:Half-Orc ~ Spheres Trained Berserk	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTraits.Half-Orc Racial Trait.SpecialQuality	PRERACE:1,Half-Orc	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Half-Orc ~ Spheres Trained Berserk],[!PREFACT:1,ABILITIES,HalfOrc_ReplaceOrcFerocity=true]	COST:0	FACT:HalfOrc_ReplaceOrcFerocity|true	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Berserker Sphere	DESC:Trained Berserk: Those of orcish descent sometimes learn to ignore lesser wounds, focusing on aggressive tactics while trusting in their own endurance. They gain the Berserker sphere as a bonus talent at 1st level. For half-orcs this replaces orc ferocity. [SA:MRT]	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alternate-racial-traits#toc27
Dwarven Battle Training	KEY:Dwarf ~ Spheres Dwarven Battle Training	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTraits.Dwarf Racial Trait.SpecialQuality	PRERACE:1,Dwarf	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Dwarf ~ Spheres Dwarven Battle Training],[!PREFACT:1,ABILITIES,Dwarf_ReplaceDefensiveTraining=true,Dwarf_ReplaceHatred=true,Dwarf_ReplaceWeaponFamiliarity=true]	COST:0	FACT:Dwarf_ReplaceDefensiveTraining|true	FACT:Dwarf_ReplaceHatred|true	FACT:Dwarf_ReplaceWeaponFamiliarity|true	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Equipment - Dwarven Heritage	DESC:Dwarven Battle Training: Many dwarves go beyond the weapon training common to their culture, mastering all their people’s weapons. They gain the Dwarven Heritage Equipment talent as a bonus talent at 1st level. This replaces defensive training, hatred and weapon familiarity.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alternate-racial-traits#toc16
Elven Ancestral Master	KEY:Elf ~ Spheres Elven Ancestral Master	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTraits.Elf Racial Trait.SpecialQuality	PRERACE:1,Elf	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Elf ~ Spheres Elven Ancestral Master],[!PREFACT:1,ABILITIES,Elf_ReplaceKeenSenses=true,Elf_ReplaceWeaponFamiliarity=true]	COST:0	FACT:Elf_ReplaceKeenSenses|true	FACT:Elf_ReplaceWeaponFamiliarity|true	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Equipment - Elvish Heritage	DESC:Elven Ancestral Master: Some elves chose to undergo a more rigorous study of their people’s armaments. They gain the Elven Heritage Equipment talent as a bonus talent at 1st level. This replaces keen senses and weapon familiarity.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alternate-racial-traits#toc18
Sling Lord	KEY:Halfling ~ Spheres Sling Lord	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTraits.Halfling Racial Trait.SpecialQuality	PRERACE:1,Halfling	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Halfling ~ Spheres Sling Lord],[!PREFACT:1,ABILITIES,Halfling_ReplaceKeenSenses=true,Halfling_ReplaceWeaponFamiliarity=true]	COST:0	FACT:Halfling_ReplaceKeenSenses|true	FACT:Halfling_ReplaceWeaponFamiliarity|true	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Equipment - Halfling Heritage	DESC:Sling Lord: True masters of the oft-maligned family of weapons, some halflings show devastating skill with slings of all types. They gain the Halfling Heritage Equipment talent as a bonus talent at 1st level. This replaces keen senses and weapon familiarity.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alternate-racial-traits#toc26
Superior Dwarven Make	KEY:Dwarf ~ Spheres Superior Dwarven Make	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTraits.Dwarf Racial Trait.SpecialQuality	PRERACE:1,Dwarf	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Dwarf ~ Spheres Superior Dwarven Make],[!PREFACT:1,ABILITIES,Dwarf_ReplaceWeaponFamiliarity=true]	COST:0	FACT:Dwarf_ReplaceWeaponFamiliarity|true	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Tinker Sphere	DESC:Superior Dwarven Make: There is much pride to be had in creating marvels, whether that be weapons and armor to complex machinery and marvels of technology. Dwarves which have made the technological leaps beyond the forge to the machine shop often enjoy piecing together perfectly fit gears into tight, interlocked patterns beneath fitted steel and iron casings. Dwarves with this racial trait gain the Tinker sphere as a bonus talent. This replaces weapon familiarity. [SUE]	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alternate-racial-traits#toc16
Refined Ingenuity	KEY:Elf ~ Spheres Refined Ingenuity	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTraits.Elf Racial Trait.SpecialQuality	PRERACE:1,Elf	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Elf ~ Spheres Refined Ingenuity],[!PREFACT:1,ABILITIES,Elf_ReplaceElvenMagic=true]	COST:0	FACT:Elf_ReplaceElvenMagic|true	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Tinker Sphere	DESC:Refined Ingenuity: Elves in more magic-deprived regions take to sculpting and shaping materials, often glass, fine metals such as gold or copper, and wood into potent apparatus. Elves pride themselves in slow, methodical crafting methods that produce high quality and long lasting pieces of innovations. Elves with this racial trait gain the Tinker sphere as a bonus talent. This replaces elven magic.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alternate-racial-traits#toc18
Gnomish Tinkering	KEY:Gnome ~ Spheres Gnomish Tinkering	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTraits.Gnome Racial Trait.SpecialQuality	PRERACE:1,Gnome	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Gnome ~ Spheres Gnomish Tinkering],[!PREFACT:1,ABILITIES,Gnome_ReplaceKeenSenses=true]	COST:0	FACT:Gnome_ReplaceKeenSenses|true	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Tinker Sphere	DESC:Gnomish Tinkering: Gnomes often take their pursuit of interest and excitement to the technological level, finding great purpose and joy in making things both useful and useless by leveraging a variety of solutions to a singular problem. Gnomes with this racial trait gain the Tinker sphere as a bonus talent. This replaces keen senses. [SUE]	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alternate-racial-traits#toc23
Alchemical Training	KEY:Gnome ~ Spheres Alchemical Training	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTraits.Gnome Racial Trait.SpecialQuality	PRERACE:1,Gnome	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Gnome ~ Spheres Alchemical Training],[!PREFACT:1,ABILITIES,Gnome_ReplaceGnomeMagic=true]	COST:0	FACT:Gnome_ReplaceGnomeMagic|true	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Alchemy Sphere	DESC:Alchemical Training: Gnomish schools and universities commonly teach the art of alchemy, and many gnomes are fortunate enough to receive such an education. They gain the Alchemy sphere as a bonus talent at 1st level. This replaces gnome magic. [SA:MRT]	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alternate-racial-traits#toc23
Titan of Industry	KEY:Human ~ Spheres Titan of Industry	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTraits.Human Racial Trait.SpecialQuality	PRERACE:1,Human	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Human ~ Spheres Titan of Industry],[!PREFACT:1,ABILITIES,Human_ReplaceBonusFeat=true]	COST:0	FACT:Human_ReplaceBonusFeat|true	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Tinker Sphere	DESC:Titan of Industry [DRS] Human cities are breeding grounds for innovation, and as a result, certain humans become further inspired as inventors. Humans with this racial trait gain the Tinker sphere as a bonus talent at 1st level.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alternate-racial-traits#toc29
